.matches-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}

.matches-table th, .matches-table td {
    padding: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;
}

.matches-table th {
    background-color: #252525;
    color: #6daa2c;
}

Rankings section as an ordered list.

.rankings-list {
    counter-reset: rankings;
}

